sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Offline Workstation
    participant B as Connected Device
    participant P as Licensing Provider
    O->>O: Generate machine-bound request
    O-->>B: Transfer request file
    B->>P: Upload request
    P-->>B: Signed response file
    B-->>O: Transfer response
    O->>O: Verify signature + machine binding
    O->>O: Cache until offline expiry
